40 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 208 0 R
/E (Our church repairs are well underway, with interior painting started in August. Work is also progressing on the mouldings for the cross and spires, with installation expected towards the end of September. We are also in the final stages of ordering our engraved pavers and hope to have them ready in about a month. Once they arrive, we will organise a working bee to install them along the edge of our paving in visible locations. We will arrange a celebration once all of the works are completed, so keep an ear out for details.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
41 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 208 0 R
/E (Unfortunately, our Second Collection Tap & Go device has been sent to the eastern states for repairs and is likely to be out of service for several weeks. We apologise for the inconvenience and thank you for your patience in the meantime.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
