43 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 208 0 R
/E (This month we also have some wonderful occasions to celebrate. On Friday, 11 September, 38 candidates from our parish community will receive the Sacrament of Confirmation. Please keep them in your prayers as they take this important step in their faith journey. Then, on Saturday, 12 September, our St Thomas Year 3 students will join us for Mass, followed by a sausage sizzle. We warmly invite everyone to come along and share in this lovely opportunity for fellowship.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
